Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,After graduating from high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.68,0:00:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Leone Abbacchio immediately\Nfollowed his deep sense
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.30,0:00:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,of justice directly into a\Njob with the police force.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But the realization of his\Ndream did little to quell the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,unease he felt from the contradictions\Nplaguing his daily work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The people he was expected to\Ndefend each day were the very ones
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,causing trouble around the city he\Nrisked his life to serve and protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,These ne 'er-do-wells seemed to revel\Nin destroying law enforcement property,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,stealing from the public, and committing\Nother heinous acts of depravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a thankless job, and the demands\Nnever seemed to stop, nor did the insults or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,verbal humiliations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He imperiled his life again and again\Nto put the dregs of society behind bars,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:01:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But this was a city where money talked,\Nand criminals, more often than not, walked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit stirring up trouble. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It don't matter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The contradictions became one\Nof Abakio's greatest teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.72,0:01:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, come on, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut us some slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't arrest a lady whose\Ndaddy was in debt, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs the cash real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just minding our own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you hurry it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.66,0:01:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a good customer over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.54,0:01:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm working on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.10,0:01:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I do arrest these bastards,\NI'll just post bail and walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll either try to pay me off,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,or they'll just throw cash\Nat the courts and lawyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real man of passion, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The kind of cop who\Ntakes his job seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.40,0:01:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, one night, reports came\Nin detailing a nearby robbery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Police! Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.74,0:02:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hey, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.06,0:02:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You again screwed the pooch this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone blew his brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.04,0:02:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just pretend you\Nnever saw this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it'll be our little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never bother you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.99,0:02:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's not be too hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.34,0:02:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you arrest me, what incentive would\NI have to keep quiet about that bribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.92,0:02:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't play with guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.74,0:02:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind pointing that thing somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Move, Abbacchio! He's got a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It was this moment that would mark the\Nbeginning of the end for Abbacchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He was labeled a dirty cop\Nand punished accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What was worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.48,0:03:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,he'd lost his partner\Nbecause of his own actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,a truth he would have to forever endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The compounding disasters sent him\Nspiraling into a deep depression.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Live, die, or suffer,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.94,0:03:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,it seemed nothing would ever free him from\Nthe grief that had entangled his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Abokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleasure's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,FIGHTING GOLD
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.80,0:05:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Solve it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:05:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let me down. Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.54,0:06:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.80,0:06:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one foley Radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,To go to these lengths to prove yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This kid's even crazier than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maledetto!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on with this stand? Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Use Golden Wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.19,0:06:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's best you remain up here, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Better yet, stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't consider Giorno one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But given his words, he thinks that\Nyou're going to come to his rescue,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.60,0:06:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as our comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.88,0:06:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, this guy's a total whack job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:06:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Those juvenile theatrics could\Nhave gotten your dumbass kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.18,0:07:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Pucerati.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to remain up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia's shoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno's powers are still active.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He could still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The others are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia and that bastard are down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Superman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, Fugo, Mista,\Nand Giorno are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Could they be right under the fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like Giorno said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy isn't hiding\Nin some locker or shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something else going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.06,0:07:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the flies coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.82,0:07:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just where is it going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.06,0:07:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How are they hiding like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've Never seen anything\Nlike these powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.12,0:08:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually Managed to get something right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna expose this bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But first we have to\NGet away from this spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Moody Jazz! Let's jam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.34,0:08:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try Narancia. Five minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What about that fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's heading toward the bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time. Work fast. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.22,0:08:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,His headphones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,About five minutes ago,\NNarancia was listening to music.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did it just stop playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever attack Narancia\Ndid so after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fast-forward a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That lira belongs to us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With capital like that,\Nwe'll claim the rank of Cape!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.46,0:09:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard my voice just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was right after this\Nthat Narancia was taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.44,0:09:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This had better show us exactly\Nhow he was attacked, Abakio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my stand can replay\Nanything it records.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We can observe everything from his\Nheart rate to his perspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And it'll follow him wherever he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.90,0:09:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The time's come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Get behind Naranta and watch\Nfor when he's grabbed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno had that same gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.62,0:10:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.64,0:10:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like watching a deflating balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's withering away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,His wound is releasing\Nair, deflating his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we got the scoop\Non this Katsune's abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.32,0:10:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's pulling him in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.40,0:10:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Habakio! Pause it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's inside the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We might find the answer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.10,0:10:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything from his nails to his bones is\Nrubbery like some kind of weird condom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Even his shoe and buckle are rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good news is, I still feel a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.44,0:11:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as Giorno said, he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That explains it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemy is also rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's shifty, hiding between\Npipes, planks, and walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how he managed to\Ncapture Mista, Fugo, and Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.58,0:11:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And why the fly got a small blip,\Nbut despite its best efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't completely hone in\Non the enemy's exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we exposed the enemy's secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we track down that rotten rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we do that, we rescue\NNarancia and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.20,0:11:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we deliver one hell of a beatdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, get ready for more moody jazz!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Track it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.40,0:11:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't attack or defend during replay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.14,0:11:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're asking for it if you go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.98,0:11:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the precise movement and\Nlocation of Moody Jazz at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.64,0:11:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When the bastard gets close, you unzip the\Nfloor and beat his ass to Kingdom Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:12:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't defeat him by sitting\Nhere, twiddling our thumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It went left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.24,0:12:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where he got Miska.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Moody Jazz is passing\Nunderneath the buoy as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.22,0:12:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's taking a detour to the\Ncabin where it got Fugo and Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So the enemy can hold them captive\Nand move them exactly where he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the fly's beginning to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the same spot he was hiding before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.28,0:12:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, on the inside of that rope tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.86,0:12:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's directly below the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems he's heading our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He might know we found out\Nthe secret behind his attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.18,0:12:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the pipes and pull them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Zipper Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They're nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's our target now, Abakio?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Moody Jazz?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt my stand\Nis still in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't see a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.90,0:13:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right where you opened the zipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trust me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where my stand is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they? Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.34,0:13:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.28,0:13:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.08,0:13:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there another mystery\Nwe haven't figured out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the replay and recall your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not recognizing this wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Which crack did you crawl into now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that hollow thud?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.46,0:13:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That sound was the pipe wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I know you can't see him, but\NMoody Jazz is currently under our noses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.16,0:13:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.07,0:13:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The pipe's wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy's right in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.22,0:13:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:13:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hiding under us somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.62,0:13:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna run?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that grating do-gooder\NGiorno Ordering me to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Solve this mystery. Impudent\Npunk. He's lucky I'm nice. Bakio
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.44,0:14:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one more mystery. And I've\Njust about cracked it. Once I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crack his skull. There was something\Nabout that mast. Something wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdraw your stand! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I just blew this whole mystery wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the coup de Crazy, Poutarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a neat trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And an impressive hideout!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.48,0:14:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.06,0:15:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab onto me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.26,0:15:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do with the?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.68,0:15:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not in the cabin\NAnd he's not in the pipe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.20,0:15:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they? What did\Nyou do to my my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.92,0:15:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you see the seagulls around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.48,0:16:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose we're finally approaching land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And I finally have you\Nall to myself, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You best!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, aspetta, aspetta, aspetta!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's talking here, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now keep that mouth shut till I tell\Nyou otherwise. Test any cats all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.70,0:16:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.14,0:16:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Know that I can eliminate\Nyou at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.56,0:16:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little minions live\Nonly because I allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in a state of suspended animation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.22,0:16:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be grateful they\Naren't sleeping with the fishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have to chop them into bite-sized\Npieces for the little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you decide to cooperate, however,\NI could return your crew to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.85,0:16:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you need to tell me where Polpo has been\Nhiding that wonderful treasure of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, are you part of Passione?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee whiz, you really just\Naren't getting it, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, Kanzone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.90,0:17:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.92,0:17:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I only want to hear about\Nthe location of the loot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to shit out anything\Nelse from that disgusting
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,bunghole slapped across your\Nface and see what happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you so much as scrunch without permission,\None of your pals are getting offed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.90,0:17:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Say nothing, and I'll kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.60,0:17:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I find out you lied, they die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Agapito, choose your words carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.57,0:17:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to address the 10 billion\Nlira manatee on the boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.82,0:17:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,where can I find the money\Nthe boss left behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Black-tailed gulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:17:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Those birds are black-tailed\Ngulls, not seagulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're wondering how I can tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.88,0:18:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,it's because they sound like\Nthey're meowing you mentioned
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.56,0:18:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,before they were seagulls but\Nthey're really black-tailed gulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.52,0:18:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to your comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.38,0:18:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If hell doesn't drag you down first?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,W-what the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.14,0:18:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't strike the deck in order to\Nfind out where you'd hidden Abakio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.52,0:18:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to create a little leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.00,0:18:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Abakio unraveled the mystery\Nbehind your special hiding spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.30,0:18:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and he was nice enough to\Nleave some evidence there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Evidence of your location and even\Nof your distinguishing features.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.74,0:18:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it with his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.66,0:19:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Abakyo went so far as to injure his own\Nhand so as to leave behind a trail of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He was taken, but the blood\Nnever seeped below the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It stops right at the floorboard, which\NI find more than a little curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.78,0:19:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were he and the others taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I rented the yacht that was on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Abakio realized that when\Nhe looked up at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cover's been blown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.54,0:19:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to drown to\Ndeath, I'd suggest coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There were two boats all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You hid yourself by stretching one yacht\Nover another like some kind of a thin skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You moved within the slim space\Ncreated between the boats,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,ambushing us as you pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the conundrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my deepest compliments.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd stay still if I were you, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you want your comrades to die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You of all people should know\Nyou wouldn't last one day as
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,a mafioso if a feeble threat\Nlike that rattled your bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up and I'll show mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But the moment you injure a Bakio,\NI'm putting you down for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.26,0:20:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like Jean said,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,your need to remain hidden while\Nattacking is a point of weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You need some speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Epakio...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.78,0:21:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravissimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.28,0:21:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.44,0:21:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaking you is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.00,0:21:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, I need your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.88,0:21:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, you got my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.68,0:22:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, you won't be sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.74,0:22:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, you got my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.28,0:22:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my mind. All I\Nwanna do is freak you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.76,0:22:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say, what must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much I'm gonna freak you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.18,0:22:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say, what must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.80,0:22:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much I'm gonna freak you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.64,0:22:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Abakion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.60,0:22:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The end result isn't what matters most.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the moments along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.76,0:23:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.62,0:23:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't live your life stuck in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.28,0:23:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.28,0:24:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You
